1
00:00:01,000 --> 00:00:04,500
Sales Invoicing is the primary revenue engine of your business.

2
00:00:05,000 --> 00:00:09,800
In this session, you will learn how to create and issue statutory GST tax invoices.

3
00:00:10,200 --> 00:00:13,800
Click the gold New Invoice button to open the billing form.

4
00:00:14,200 --> 00:00:18,500
Select your customer. Their billing address and GSTIN populate automatically.

5
00:00:19,000 --> 00:00:23,600
The Place of Supply determines Central and State GST versus Integrated GST.

6
00:00:24,000 --> 00:00:28,200
Add line items, review HSN codes, and configure custom discount percentages.

7
00:00:28,800 --> 00:00:33,000
Notice the Auto Round-Off calculation to the nearest whole rupee.

8
00:00:33,500 --> 00:00:37,800
Toggle on the dynamic UPI QR code to print instant payment links.

9
00:00:38,200 --> 00:00:43,000
Click Save and Issue to update inventory, post receivables, and book tax liability.

10
00:00:43,500 --> 00:00:48,000
Click Print to view your branded PDF invoice ready for dispatch.
